(meta (title "About this site")
      (date 2026-09-27))

@section{What is where}

Every @code{.sz} file is a page, and every folder is a menu of what is in it.
A folder's @code{index.sz} is the page above its menu, and says how the menu
is sorted.

@read-table{
| In the folder                | At the URL                |
|------------------------------+---------------------------|
| @code{about.sz}              | @code{/about.html}        |
| @code{notes/}                | @code{/notes/}            |
| @code{notes/index.sz}        | the top of @code{/notes/} |
| @code{files/hello.bjo}       | @code{/files/hello.bjo}   |
| @code{_drafts/unfinished.sz} | nowhere                   |
}

@section{Hidden}

A name that begins with @code{_} or @code{.} is hidden. This site has three
hidden folders: @code{_parts}, with pieces of pages that others include;
@code{_drafts}, with a page that is not ready; and @code{_resources}, the one
whose files are served, which has the
@link["/_resources/glasnost.css"]{style sheet} that colours the links.

@section{How it looks}

The page is set in whatever font your browser uses. glasnost's own style
sheet chooses colours, a column and some space, and follows your light or
dark preference. The site's comes after it, and may change anything.
